ry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"77210027\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Stainless Steel High Efficient Submersible Pump</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240856432257330.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><br/></p><p>4 Inch Stainless Steel High Efficient Submersible Pump is one of our major product. For more than 25 years, JIADI has been the most reliable and loyal supplier and friend of many customers. And we will keep sticking to our customer-oriented principle and manufacturing more and more quality pumps.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4SVm100</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor:</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">oil filled</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">For use with what product?</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Water Well</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">57m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.75 kW/ 1 HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Impeller Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Copper</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">452 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1 inch</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240 volts, 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">One year manufacturer's warranty from the purchase date for parts and labor.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240858074091503.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240858103021167.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Application</strong></p><p>Domestic water supply</p><p>Livestock watering</p><p>Gardens or fountains </p><p>Pond management</p><p>Irrigation in horticulture &amp; agriculture</p><p>Small scale service industries</p><p>etc.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240858181528441.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Operating Conditions</strong></p><p>Maximum fluid temperature up to +35Cº</p><p>Maximum immersion: 45m </p><p>Minimum well diameter:4\"</p><p><strong>6. Company Profile</strong></p><p>JIADI is a highly mobile, rapid response oriented company that evolved from the early years of small pump making operation into a fully equipped and experienced company capable of providing quality pumps and high-class service. We are reliable for we would answer every question we receive and we are responsible for we will pay attention to each pump we sell. The series of our pumps include QJ, SR, SP, SK, QGDA, EGDA, EGD, QG, QDX, VSM. </p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240858216759344.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240858258162420.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240858299408244.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001 </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Those certificates can guarantee that we make pumps with sincerity and our pumps can be applied to many situations. Please trust us and we will offer you the best service. </p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Do you have any Certificate?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we have ISO14001, OHSAS18001, CE, GS, ISO9001, RoHS or others as requirement.</p><p><strong>2. Q: Can I laser print my logo upon the product?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we offer laser print for customers. And most of our products can be laser printed, others can be labeled. If you need to do it, please tell us.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Where are your main markets?</strong></p><p>A: We sell products in South Asia, Mid East and Africa mainly.</p><p><strong>4. Q: Do you attend any shows/fairs?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we have attended many Fairs, and currently, E-commerce has been a trend, more and more customers prefer to search thing online. We will keep on attending fairs and pay more attention to the online selling.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch stainless steel high efficient submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/5-inch-high-head-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"5 Inch High Head Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/bore-hole-submersible-pump25347264017a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/5-inch-high-head-submersible-pump\">5 Inch High Head Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/6-inch-big-capacity-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"6 Inch Big Capacity Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/agricultural-submersible-pump40593228970a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/6-inch-big-capacity-submersible-pump\">6 Inch Big Capacity Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/sta